## MAUI / mobile
*.binlog
*.aab
*.apk
*.ipa
# NOTE: do not add "*.app" here. Git on Windows matches ignore patterns case-insensitively
# (core.ignorecase=true), so "*.app" also matches the src/Forge.App project directory and
# silently excludes the entire app from the repository - csproj, MauiProgram and all. macOS
# .app bundles are build output and are already covered by bin/, obj/ and artifacts/.
*.dSYM/
*.appx
*.appxbundle
*.appxupload
*.msix
*.msixbundle
*.appxsym
Platforms/Android/Resources/Resource.designer.cs

