## Tooling
node_modules/
.tools/
*.received.*

## backlog sync local state
tools/backlog-sync/.state/

## JVM crash dumps. The Android toolchain runs javac, d8 and aapt2 on a JVM, and this build host
## is contended enough that one occasionally dies and drops an hs_err_pid*.log wherever it was
## working. One got swept into a commit by git add -A.
hs_err_pid*.log
replay_pid*.log

